      "value": "<p><em>“It’s not that you’re faster. It’s that the moment is slower, on your side of it.”</em></p><p><strong>Stormread.</strong> You have a flat +2 bonus to initiative. Additionally, once per Soma Break, as a bonus action, you may deliver a warning to one willing ally within 30 feet who can hear and understand you. That ally may immediately use their reaction to move up to half their speed without provoking reaction strikes.</p>",
